     "text": "a chain of strangers,"
    },
    {
     "from": 1581,
     "to": 1622,
     "text": "each trusting the last."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "chapter": 2,
   "from": 1633,
   "to": 1744,
   "text": "Stitch every announcement together, and the map draws itself.",
   "para": false,
   "subs": [
